WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.340
Unit fifteen. Friendship Skills!

2
00:00:04.305 --> 00:00:07.905
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.955 --> 00:00:11.163
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.213 --> 00:00:14.852
Today we learn about Friendship Skills. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.735 --> 00:00:19.035
Friendship. Say it with me. Friendship!

6
00:00:22.569 --> 00:00:25.886
Listen. Say it with me. Listen!

7
00:00:29.386 --> 00:00:32.819
Share. Say it with me. Share!

8
00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:39.910
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

9
00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:46.701
Kind. Say it with me. Kind!

10
00:00:50.174 --> 00:00:53.874
Include. Say it with me. Include!

11
00:00:57.379 --> 00:01:01.046
Sorry. Say it with me. Sorry!

12
00:01:04.565 --> 00:01:07.965
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

13
00:01:11.457 --> 00:01:20.453
Friendship grows when I listen, share, and show respect. I include others and say sorry when I hurt someone. Good friends trust each other.

14
00:01:20.503 --> 00:01:21.802
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.085 --> 00:01:28.292
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.342 --> 00:01:29.492
Share!

17
00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:35.553
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.603 --> 00:01:36.753
Sorry!

19
00:01:37.573 --> 00:01:41.858
Did you know? Having good friends can help people feel less stressed!

20
00:01:41.908 --> 00:01:43.969
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.457 --> 00:01:52.630
Think and answer. What makes someone a good friend?

22
00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:53.830
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.026 --> 00:02:00.170
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.956
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

